{"unit_id":"WJPGKZ__dsh-ego-local-browser#card-zh","repo":"WJPGKZ/dsh-ego-local-browser","commit":"b7329f7445a15dc6088ef29620f5704c42c0ff60","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ego-local-browser 为 DSH 提供可见的本机浏览器自动化。它注册 ego_real 工具，通过本机桥接和 Chrome/Edge 扩展操作用户正在使用的真实浏览器，可打开页面、切换标签、读取语义快照、点击、填写、滚动、截图和等待页面变化；手势式阅读与点击会显示鲸鱼娘光标。插件也保留 agent 浏览器工具，并提供按域名名单同步登录态、检查浏览器状态的工具及设置页。适合需要 DSH 代为操作网页、同时在浏览器中查看过程的用户；真实浏览器模式需要加载随包扩展。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/real-browser-tools.mjs:22-31","lib/index.js:3539-3542"]}
{"unit_id":"WJPGKZ__dsh-ego-local-browser#card-en","repo":"WJPGKZ/dsh-ego-local-browser","commit":"b7329f7445a15dc6088ef29620f5704c42c0ff60","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ego-local-browser lets DSH operate Chrome or Edge through a bundled extension and bridge. ego_real reads snapshots, clicks, fills, scrolls, takes screenshots, and waits, with cursor feedback. It also offers agent-browser tools and login sync; real-browser use requires loading the extension.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/real-browser-tools.mjs:22-31","lib/index.js:3539-3542"]}
