{"unit_id":"WJPGKZ__dsh-ego-local-browser#feature-feature-1","repo":"WJPGKZ/dsh-ego-local-browser","commit":"b7329f7445a15dc6088ef29620f5704c42c0ff60","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ego-local-browser 的功能「操作真实浏览器」：通过 ego_real 选择 Chrome 或 Edge，打开或导航页面、切换标签、点击和填写控件，并可滚动或执行页面表达式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/real-browser-tools.mjs:350-384"]}
