{"unit_id":"WJPGKZ__dsh-ego-local-browser#caveat-1","repo":"WJPGKZ/dsh-ego-local-browser","commit":"b7329f7445a15dc6088ef29620f5704c42c0ff60","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ego-local-browser 使用真实浏览器模式时，需要先在 Chrome 或 Edge 加载随包扩展；插件会通过本机 127.0.0.1:18765 桥接接收操作请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/real-browser-tools.mjs:22-31","real-browser/bridge/server.mjs:37-39"]}
